## Summary

| Pattern | Protection | Example |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Type validation | Type confusion attacks | `Number.isInteger()` |
| Range validation | Buffer overflow | `limit < 1 or > 100` |
| Length validation | DoS, overflow | `maxLength: 100` |
| HTML escaping | XSS | `validator.escape()` |
| Parameterized queries | SQL injection | `db.query(sql, [params])` |
| Password hashing | Credential theft | `bcrypt.hash()` |
| JWT validation | Unauthorized access | `jwt.verify()` |
| Rate limiting | Brute force, DoS | `express-rate-limit` |
| CORS whitelist | Cross-origin attacks | `cors({ origin: [...] })` |
| Safe logging | Info disclosure | No passwords/tokens |

