| Rate Limiting | Minimal (memory) | Prevents DoS |
| Input Validation | Minimal (string ops) | Prevents attacks |
| Sanitization | Small (regex) | Prevents injection |
| Error Handling | Minimal | Stability |
| Request Logging | Small (I/O) | Debugging/security audits |

**Conclusion:** Security overhead is negligible compared to security benefits.

