### **Summary of Security Improvements**

| Issue | Severity | Solution |
|-------|----------|----------|
| No input validation | High | Add express-validator |
| No error handling | High | Add try-catch & error middleware |
| Sensitive data exposure | High | Add authentication/RBAC |
| Missing security headers | Medium | Add helmet.js |
